; claude: the office applications (see
; docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_gui_teaching.md): whole programs rather
; than demonstrations of one idea, each Tiny and each saying in its
; header what it deliberately does not do -- word processing and
; publishing, spreadsheets, presentations, paint and draw, authoring and
; compound documents (CATALOG.md's sections). Laid out like a genre of
; games/, with software/ for the golden frames and web/ for the browser.
;
; The modules here that are not programs are shared by them: the
; parts of a compound document (Part_text, Part_sheet, Part_picture,
; Part_drawing, Part_chart) and Figure_shapes. When an app of another
; category needs one, it becomes an appkit, as File_menu and
; Stroke_text did (appkits/file_menu, appkits/stroke_text).
(executables
  (names
    TinyVisiCalc TinyExcel TinyBravo TinyWord TinyMacPaint TinyOpenDoc TinyPowerPoint TinyHyperCard TinyMacDraw TinyFrameMaker TinyOffice
  )
  (libraries
    elm_playground
    caps ; the File menu's authority to save (File_menu, plan_caps.md)
    gui ; Widget, for text_width
    appkit_sheet ; Formula and Sheet, the engine
    appkit_sheet_view ; a sheet drawn into a rectangle (TinyExcel)
    appkit_document ; Undo (TinyBravo, TinyWord)
    appkit_file_menu ; File_menu
    appkit_richtext ; text with looks, and its page (TinyBravo, TinyWord)
    appkit_paint ; a picture as bits, and what paints it (TinyMacPaint)
    appkit_embed ; a document of parts (TinyOpenDoc, TinyPowerPoint)
    appkit_slides ; a talk as an outline (TinyPowerPoint)
    appkit_hypertalk ; HyperCard's language (TinyHyperCard)
    appkit_draw ; a picture as objects (TinyMacDraw)
    appkit_stroke_text ; Hershey's strokes in a look
    elm_playground_native ; implem of virtual elm_playground
  )
)
